  {
    quote:
      "Sharmi helped our team do the foundational work that launched our ABM strategy. She took unstructured goals and, by applying her customer-focused insight and technical know-how, turned them into specific solutions that optimized our entire enrichment project in HubSpot.",
    name: "Shreyas Mecheri",
