  },
  {
    q: "Does Renewal Builder replace HubSpot Revenue Hub?",
    a: "No. HubSpot Revenue Hub supports contracts, billing, and renewal quotes. Renewal Builder is for teams that need a repeatable renewal-deal workflow built around their existing HubSpot pipelines, deal records, line items, and associations.",
  },
  {
    q: "Will the app change my source deal?",
